        "original_id": "5bf9d3ac-f702-5b4f-af39-ab3f9ce7025b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Leckie, Nigel Godrich, Stanley Donwood, Johnny Greenwood\n- Albums: a live album by the band, another album by the band\n- Songs: \"Planet Telex\"\n- Roles: producer, engineer, artwork, Controller\n\nFacts:\n- John Leckie produced the live album, and Nigel Godrich engineered it.\n- Stanley Donwood created the artwork for the live album and also created the artwork for another album by the same band.\n- Johnny Greenwood is credited as the Controller on the live album.\n- \"Planet Telex\" is the opening track on the live album.",
