        "original_id": "0a4d76e5-f938-5965-9a43-e898728b98a5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jonny Greenwood, Stanley Donwood, John Leckie, Nigel Godrich\n- Organizations: Radiohead, Trojan Records, Parlophone Records, Capitol Records\n- Products: Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller, The Bends, Planet Telex\n\nFacts:\n- The Bends is the second studio album by Radiohead and was released on 13 March 1995 by Parlophone Records in the United Kingdom and by Capitol Records in the United States.\n- The Bends was produced by John Leckie and engineered by Nigel Godrich, who later co-produced all future Radiohead albums.\n- Planet Telex is a song written by Radiohead and is the opening track of The Bends.\n- Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller is a compilation album created by Jonny Greenwood of Radiohead and released on Trojan Records.\n- Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller features artwork by Stanley Donwood, who has provided art for every Radiohead album since The Bends in 1995.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
